# Nothing is deployed on Vercel any more (2026-11-17: one backend and the one app, on Coolify).
# Kept so the Vercel CLI, if anyone runs it here, sends no secrets, local data or installed
# packages (it doesn't read .gitignore). bishnoi-one-app/frontend/vercel.json keeps Vercel
# from building on push.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.data
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.next

# Local assistant context
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
